      "en": {
        "title": "Minecraft is officially getting its first new dimension in 15 years",
        "description": "New Minecraft dimension The Sift is also coming to Dungeons 2 next week",
        "fullContent": "New Minecraft dimension The Sift is also coming to Dungeons 2 next week\n\nMinecraft is getting its first new dimension in 15 years, developer Mojang announced during its Minecraft Live stream on Saturday.\n\nDimensions are parallel worlds within Minecraft with unique biomes and structures. Minecraft’s last dimension, The End, was released back in October 2011.\n\nRevealed on Saturday, Minecraft’s next new dimension is The Sift, which is described as “beautiful, vibrant, and teeming with souls”.\n\nThe Sift is set to debut in Minecraft Dungeons 2, which releases on September 29. Then, next year, the dimension will come to Minecraft’s Java and Bedrock editions, Mojang said.\n\nDuring the Minecraft Live broadcast, viewers got a glimpse into the dimension and its unique, bunny-like mobs. In addition, it confirmed that Ice Caves will be coming to the main game, along with new ice zombie variants."
      },
      "es": {
        "title": "Minecraft obtiene oficialmente su primera nueva dimensión en 15 años",
        "description": "New Minecraft dimension The Sift is also coming to Dungeons 2 next week",
        "fullContent": "New Minecraft dimension The Sift is also coming to Dungeons 2 next week\n\nMinecraft está obteniendo su primera nueva dimensión en 15 años, anunció el desarrollador Mojang durante su transmisión en vivo de Minecraft el sábado.\n\nLas dimensiones son mundos paralelos dentro de Minecraft con biomas y estructuras únicas. La última dimensión de Minecraft, The End, se lanzó en octubre de 2011.\n\nRevelada el sábado, la próxima nueva dimensión de Minecraft es The Sift, que se describe como \"hermosa, vibrante y llena de almas\".\n\nEl Sift debutará en Minecraft Dungeons 2, que se lanzará el 29 de septiembre. Luego, el próximo año, la dimensión llegará a las ediciones Java y Bedrock de Minecraft, dijo Mojang.\n\nDurante la transmisión de Minecraft Live, los espectadores pudieron vislumbrar la dimensión y sus mobs únicos, parecidos a conejitos. In addition, it confirmed that Ice Caves will be coming to the main game, along with new ice zombie variants."
      }
